{"t":"Jungle Grass","s":"jungle-grass-2154d","k":"item","i":"assets/wiki/Jungle_Grass_de598f.gif","q":7,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Jungle Grass</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n<img alt=\"Jungle Grass\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"46\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Jungle_Grass_de598f.gif\" width=\"46\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"objectclass\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Classification</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Flooring<br/>Grass</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Field Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"immobile\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Movable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"walkable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Blocking</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"no-cross\" title=\"No\">✗</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">6.0<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">November 3, 2000<br/>Version 6.0 Beta</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20060824233848&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Jungle_Grass_de598f.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  jungle grass.<div class=\"p-weight\"></div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p>North part of <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a>, all over <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Claw%20Swamp\">Green Claw Swamp</a> and other swampy areas.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Can be cut with a <a href=\"#/wiki/Machete\">Machete</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Heavy%20Machete\">Heavy Machete</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Whacking%20Driller%20of%20Fate\">Whacking Driller of Fate</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Sneaky%20Stabber%20of%20Eliteness\">Sneaky Stabber of Eliteness</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Squeezing%20Gear%20of%20Girlpower\">Squeezing Gear of Girlpower</a>. When you cut Jungle Grass, it will grow back after 5 minutes. There is an exception, though. The <a href=\"#/wiki/Femor%20Hills%20Tower\">Femor Hills Tower</a> is guarded by ultra-fast growing Jungle Grass, which grows as fast as you can cut it.<br/>You can cut the <a href=\"#/wiki/Femor%20Hills%20Tower\">Femor Hills Tower</a>'s magic Jungle Grass after you \"advance in lawn mowing\" by cleaning the garden of <a href=\"#/wiki/Hoggle\">Hoggle</a> as a part of the <a href=\"#/quest/kissing-a-pig-quest\">Kissing a Pig Quest</a>.<br/>\nCut 100 of these to obtain the achievement Nothing Can Stop Me.\n<span style=\"line-height: 20px; margin-top: 13px;\"><i> <b>See also:</b> Jungle Grass (Tile) and Objects </i> </span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/blood-herb-quest\">Blood Herb Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Dawnfire%20Herb%20Plant\">Dawnfire Herb Plant</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/dawnport-quest\">Dawnport Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Femor%20Hills%20Tower\">Femor Hills Tower</a></li><li>Flooring</li><li>Grass</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Heavy%20Machete\">Heavy Machete</a></li><li>Jungle Grass (Tile)</li><li><a href=\"#/quest/kissing-a-pig-quest\">Kissing a Pig Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Machete\">Machete</a></li><li>Nothing Can Stop Me</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Sneaky%20Stabber%20of%20Eliteness\">Sneaky Stabber of Eliteness</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/spring-into-life\">Spring into Life</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Squeezing%20Gear%20of%20Girlpower\">Squeezing Gear of Girlpower</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-inquisition-quest\">The Inquisition Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/the-paradox-tower-quest\">The Paradox Tower Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Whacking%20Driller%20of%20Fate\">Whacking Driller of Fate</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["blood-herb-quest","dawnport-quest","kissing-a-pig-quest","skull-of-ratha-quest","spring-into-life","the-inquisition-quest","the-paradox-tower-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{